
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.Fabs(Value: number): number`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`float llFabs(float Value);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  use math.abs because Double precision; fastcall.</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Returns a float that is the positive version of <b>val</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>Value / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/val" target="_blank">val</a></td>
          <td>Any valid float value</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>math</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">7</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-pure">Side-Effect Free</span>
        <span class="attr-label bg-native">Native Coded</span>
        <span class="lua-section attr-label bg-deprecated">Lua Deprecated</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>This function is similar to functions (e.g. <a href="http://www.cplusplus.com/reference/cmath/fabs/" target="_blank">fabs</a>) found in many other languages:</p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><b>C++</b></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="http://www.cplusplus.com/reference/cmath/fabs/" target="_blank">fabs</a></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function main()
    ll.Say(0, "The (Float)absolute value of -4.5 is: " .. tostring(ll.Fabs(-4.5)))
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        llSay(0,"The (Float)absolute value of -4.5 is: "+(string)llFabs(-4.5) );
    }
}
// returns :
// The (Float)absolute value of -4.5 is: 4.500000`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <h2>Notes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Using `<b>val</b>-2<i><b>val</b></i>(<b>val</b><0)` is roughly 60% faster than llFabs as it avoids a function call, though it produces NaN if given an infinite value and (correctly) returns 0.0 instead of -0.0 when taking the absolute value of negative zero.</li>
  </ul>
