        <td><div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`
function float llFabs( float val );
`} lang="lsl" /></div>

</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>Haiku</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><p>Even with all your little bits intact,</p>
<p>down to the final point</p>
<p>it's still size that matters.</p></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
